      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Anticoagulants and antiplatelets are contraindicated; reverse anticoag effects when poss w FFP, PCC, vit K or platelet transfusions as indicated; DOAC antidotes: idarucizumab (dabigatran), andexanet alfa (apixaban, rivaroxaban)"
     }
    ]
