    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Early evacuation of lrg lobar hematomas may be lifesaving, but rebleeding occurs frequently; early evacuation of deep hematomas = seldom indicated (surg mortality = ↑ and deficits are USU severe)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
